  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Acceleration due to gravity at the given height, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced><mi>R</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mi>g</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi></math> is acceleration due to gravity at the surface of the Earth.</p><p>Now, time period is given by, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>Also the time period of second pendulum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> sec.</p><p>Therefore, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mi>sec</mi></math></p><p>Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
